<title>UK: LIFFE COCOA, COFFEE GAIN GROUND IN THIN TRADE AM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE COCOA, COFFEE GAIN GROUND IN THIN TRADE AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Firms in thin volume, two front months dominate. Sept up five at 1,026 stg by 1007 GMT. Currency movements still focus.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Gains ground across board but ranges tight, turnover light. Sept up $14 at $1,629.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Oct focus of light activity, up 90 cents at $321.00.</p>
</text>
